harlesHoskinson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Add a concrete Rust/Quint comparison for the existing reserve lifecycle: failed conditions preserve pending state while attempted work continues to accrue. Both consumers are checked against a separately frozen complete financial/work expectation.\n\nValidation on `f15214ab7a885a4dc3194002cbacbb56841fdcbf`: new Rust regression 1 passed; continuation helper suite 5 passed; Quint 0.32.0 typecheck and one explicitly selected TypeScript deterministic test passed. The five actual captured ITF observations decode to exactly the Rust observations and independent oracle. Committed work is 11/11/26/26/36; cumulative attempted work is 11/15/30/32/42; final residual duty is 5.\n\nScope: one finite normal reserve trace and explicit bounded adapter. Initial/prefix Quint frames are pure assertions, separate from emitted lifecycle observations. No exhaustive invariant, circuit, native proof, ledger or target qualification. Fresh independent source/result review remains pending; this PR is draft. Root export parsing initially assumed the marker began a line; that evidence-handling error is retained and corrected without rerunning the consumers.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-18T12:22:32Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T12:22:32Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"08a751d29c08f9e312909398dd9f8298a618857c","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"CharlesHoskinson:doctorwatson-language/reserve-quint-projection-20261018","ref":"doctorwatson-language/reserve-quint-projection-20261018","repo":{"id":1360485122,"node_id":"R_kgDOURdbAg","name":"Moriarty","full_name":"CharlesHoskinson/Moriarty","owner":{"login":"CharlesHoskinson","id":3279952,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzk5NTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3279952?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.gi